Political Science#,#Political Science#,#HASS Concentration in Political Science#,#Concentration in Political Science

A concentration in Political Science requires three subjects forming a focused, cohesive grouping. Cannot be comprised of three introductory-level subjects. One subject may be taken outside the Political Science department.

intro_polisci, "Introductory Political Science" := 17.000, 17.006, 17.007, 17.01, 17.021, 17.03, 17.031, 17.035, 17.04, 17.043, 17.045, 17.05, 17.055, 17.20, 17.30, 17.40, 17.41, 17.42, 17.46, 17.50

advanced_polisci, "Advanced Political Science" := 17.100, 17.115, 17.150, 17.154, 17.156, 17.174, 17.178, 17.181, 17.182, 17.198, 17.200, 17.202, 17.210, 17.251, 17.262, 17.263, 17.265, 17.269, 17.270, 17.271, 17.275, 17.276, 17.279, 17.28, 17.303, 17.307, 17.309, 17.310, 17.315, 17.317, 17.320, 17.381, 17.389, 17.391, 17.393, 17.395, 17.399, 17.407, 17.408, 17.410, 17.411, 17.416, 17.418, 17.424, 17.426, 17.428, 17.430, 17.432, 17.433, 17.434, 17.445, 17.446, 17.447, 17.448, 17.449, 17.452, 17.456, 17.468, 17.472, 17.473, 17.474, 17.478, 17.480, 17.482, 17.483, 17.484, 17.486, 17.488, 17.490, 17.503, 17.504, 17.506

all_polisci, "All Political Science Courses" := intro_polisci / advanced_polisci

depth_requirement, "Depth Requirement" := (intro_polisci){>=0, <=2}, (advanced_polisci){>=1}
%% Cannot have three introductory courses; must have at least one advanced

total_requirement, "Three Political Science Subjects" := (all_polisci){>=3}

total, "Total Requirements" := depth_requirement, total_requirement

